ts, have all been within normal limits. Regular monitoring of INR for warfarin therapy is conducted to ensure therapeutic levels are maintained.\n\n• Other Findings - The patient reports no significant new symptoms. Physical examination reveals no abnormalities in cardiovascular, respiratory, or abdominal exams. Routine vaccinations are up to date, and the patient is advised to continue regular follow-ups to monitor atrial fibrillation and overall cardiovascular health.\n\nNext Steps:\n- Continue current warfarin therapy, with regular INR Maintain a healthy li"
